<title>USA: ASARCO details pay award to Glover workers.</title>
<headline>ASARCO details pay award to Glover workers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The new labor deal ratified by 132 employees at ASARCO's Glover, Missouri lead facility includes a pay hike of 95 cents per hour over the three-year term, including 35 cents in the first and second years, and 25 cents in the final year, the company said.</p>
<p>The new agreement, signed with United Steelworkers of America Local 7450, ends March 31, 2000.</p>
<p>The deal also included further health and drug benefits, and improvements to life insurance and pension plans, ASARCO said.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
